lingbot_navi/navigation_transformer/model/ego_blocks/pi3_pose.py. No Pi3 pretrained weights are included.

Qwen3.5-4B base model and LingBot-Navi checkpoint
Copyright 2026 Alibaba Cloud.
Source: https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; see licenses/LICENSE.Qwen3.5.
LingBot-Navi uses Qwen3.5-4B through Hugging Face Transformers and adds learned
spatial-memory conditioning, spatial/trajectory adapters, structured output
tokens, and coordinate, pose and trajectory prediction components.
The complete LingBot-Navi checkpoint combines base-model weights and task
parameters in one safetensors file, with adjacent tokenizer and processor files.
It is a LingBot-Navi derivative, not an unchanged official Qwen checkpoint.
This modification notice was added by LingBot-Navi; it is not an upstream
Qwen NOTICE file. Model weights are distributed separately from this repository.

